    "description": "MT Genex Corporation, together with its subsidiaries, engages in renovation of office buildings and real estate management in Japan. It operates through four segments: Renewal, Parking Lots, Facility Maintenance and Management, and Insurance Agency. The company is involved in operation and management of parking lots and bicycle parking facilities; construction work, including restoration work, interior work, and overall building repair and renovation projects; and building management, property management services, supply of toilet paper and other supply services, fire safety inspection and reporting services, disaster prevention management inspection and reporting services, and vending machine operation and management. The company also offers real estate development, hotel management, and investment business; and non-life insurance agency business. The company was founded in 1945 and is headquartered in Minato, Japan. MT Genex Corporation operates as a subsidiary of Mori Trust Co., Ltd."
